elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">科大讯飞发布40克轻量化AI眼镜，搭载星火大模型与GlassClaw助理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic完成650亿美元融资，投后估值达9650亿美元并发布Claude Opus 4.8</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Coral Board端侧AI开发板，支持Gemma3模型本地运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/aad2276ea4c1e6430cb65bb6d53d68fb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌在2026年Google I/O大会上正式发布Coral Board开发板，这款专为端侧AI设计的单板计算机搭载基于RISC-V架构的Coral NPU及Synaptics Astra SL2619芯片。硬件配置包括2GHz双核处理器与2GB内存，提供1TOPS本地算力，旨在满足耳机、AR眼镜及智能手表等低功耗设备需求。得益于垂直硬件优化，谷歌开源轻量化模型Gemma3 270M可实现完全离线运行，无需云端算力支持。现场演示涵盖实时翻译、语音控制及基于YOLOv8的视觉追踪生成式表演。目前相关演示代码已在GitHub开源，硬件预计于今年夏季正式发货。Coral Board的推出标志着端侧AI芯片正向开源架构与高集成度演进，为小参数模型在垂直场景的应用提供了硬件支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯正式发布电脑管家Mac版，首创AI安全沙箱防御Prompt注入攻击</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29353823a0df5f54ed5fdba5440821ac.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯近日正式推出电脑管家Mac版，填补了Mac生态系统级管家工具的空白。该版本核心亮点是业内首创的“龙虾管家”AI安全沙箱，专门针对AI Agent面临的恶意Prompt注入、脚本漏洞及权限滥用等威胁。通过在系统层为AI应用构建独立沙箱，该工具可实时拦截恶意提示词，并对AI应用的底层组件进行深度漏洞扫描，严密监控其调用系统命令、读写文件及网络访问行为。在隐私防护方面，新版本将macOS原有的被动授权机制升级为主动拦截防御，重点覆盖摄像头、麦克风、屏幕截取及自动化操作四类核心隐私通道。此外，该软件还集成了清理加速功能，并内置“AI应用广场”，聚合了元宝、QClaw、workbuddy、ChatGPT及DeepSeek等主流AI工具，为用户提供从发现到防护的完整闭环体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">科大讯飞发布40克轻量化AI眼镜，搭载星火大模型与GlassClaw助理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/28c9d155ab509d998cdd481391c9de2e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">科大讯飞于BEYOND Expo 2026正式发布全新AI眼镜，标志着星火大模型能力从语音交互拓展至视野交互。该设备重40克，较同类产品轻约20%，实现无感佩戴。核心功能方面，眼镜支持122种语言实时语音与视觉翻译，并首次应用“唇动识别降噪”技术，确保复杂环境下的翻译精度。针对商务场景，内置“智能提词”功能及实体遥控器，并搭载GlassClaw AI助理，无需手机辅助即可独立完成信息采集、方案整理及邮件发送等任务。科大讯飞表示，该产品旨在通过声音与智能化助理重塑交互体验。新品定价4299元，将于6月15日正式开启预售。在当前全球AI眼镜市场从技术验证向消费突围的背景下，科大讯飞凭借软硬一体的深度耦合，为激烈的“百镜大战”注入了新的技术变数。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic完成650亿美元融资，投后估值达9650亿美元并发布Claude Opus 4.8</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic今日宣布完成650亿美元H系列融资，投后估值攀升至9650亿美元，此轮融资由Altimeter Capital与红杉资本领投，三星等战略伙伴跟投，包含亚马逊此前承诺的50亿美元注资。作为IPO前的关键私募轮次，该资金将助力公司进一步扩张。同日，Anthropic正式发布Claude Opus 4.8大模型，该模型在智能体任务、高级代码编写及自我修正能力上实现显著提升。得益于企业级代码工具需求的爆发，Anthropic年化收入已突破470亿美元，预计同比增长130%，即将实现首次运营盈利。此次融资进一步加剧了其与OpenAI在资本市场及AI赛道的竞争，双方均在加速推进IPO进程以抢占行业高地。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
